</figure>

<p>
Some dànbǐng (literally egg pancake, a popular Taiwanese breakfast
dish) filled with small pieces of pork tenderloin for breakfast. Woke
up earlier today than usual, and found that there were still breakfast
resturaunts open. Hopefully this means that I am slowly weaning myself
off of the jetlag.
</p>
