<figure id="org2376f91">
<img src="./static/display/2026-08-14-1600x.webp" alt="Japanese Beef Donburi and Onigiri from 7-eleven." loading="eager" decoding="async">

</figure>

<p>
Japanese Beef Donburi and a couple of Onigiri.
</p>

<p>
Today I woke up very late (due to being jet-lagged) and ended up
talking to my roommate the rest of the day. By the time I realized I
had not eaten for 24 hours all the restaurants were closed, and so I
went down to the local 7-eleven and bought some simple pre-prepared
meals. The Donburi was very good, but the fillings of the Onigiri were
disappointing for different reasons.
</p>
<div class="taglist"></div>]]></description>
