<figure id="org2ade4a1">
<img src="./static/display/2026-08-13-1600x.webp" alt="Classic Taiwanese stinky tofy." loading="eager" decoding="async">

</figure>

<p>
This is the (appropriately named I might add) stinky tofu, one of the
signature dishes of Taiwan. I ate it at a very popular and bustling
restaurant with a wonderful atmosphere, but realized soon after
ordering that I only had enough cash on me to cover the meal itself,
not including anything to drink. &ldquo;Not a problem&rdquo; I thought. &ldquo;I&rsquo;ll go
and have something to drink afterwards&rdquo;. Lets just say I was
practically running to the 7-eleven next door after paying.
</p>
<div class="taglist"></div>]]></description>
