</div>

<figure id="org61557bc">
<img src="./static/display/2026-08-11-1600x.webp" alt="A small piece of Chinese fruit-filled candy." loading="eager" decoding="async">

</figure>

<p>
The second day of airplane travel, although what feels like one,
continuous day. My flight was unfortunately grounded for 5 hours,
meaning that my short 2.5 hour trip from Beijing to Taipei became
almost as long as the original transcontinental flight from Stockholm
to Beijing. The clear highlight was this candy that the kind woman
next to me offered. I had thankfully brought some famous Swedish
<i>plockgodis</i> that I gave to her in return.
</p>
<div class="taglist"></div>]]></description>
